{"name":"Deco Rose","hex":"#9e6370","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"deco","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Decompression."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A friendship book in which people add decorative elements such as drawings, stickers and sequins.","Clipping of decoration."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/deco"},{"term":"rose","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A shrub of the genus Rosa, with red, pink, white or yellow flowers.","A flower of the rose plant."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make rose-colored; to redden or flush.","To perfume, as with roses."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rose"}],"entries":[{"title":"Deco","blocks":[{"text":"Anderson Luís de Souza, also known as Deco, is a former professional footballer who primarily played as an attacking or central midfielder. Born and raised in Brazil, he played for the Portugal national team. He currently works as sporting director for Barcelona. Deco is widely considered one of the best midfielders of his generation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Deco_com_o_Fluminense_em_2013_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Deco_com_o_Fluminense_em_2013_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deco","wikidata":"Q659634"},{"title":"Rose","blocks":[{"text":"A rose is either a woody perennial flowering plant of the genus Rosa, in the family Rosaceae, or the flower it bears. There are over three hundred species and tens of thousands of cultivars. The plants range in size and form, from trailing and erect shrubs to climbers up to 7 metres (23 ft) in height. Sharp prickles appear on the stems of many species. Their flowers vary in size and shape and are usually large and showy, in colours ranging from white through pinks, reds, oranges and yellows."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Rosa_rubiginosa_1.jpg/330px-Rosa_rubiginosa_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rose","wikidata":"Q34687"},{"title":"Rose (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Rose is the color halfway between red and magenta, whose hue corresponds to an angle of 330 degrees on the HSV/HSL color wheel."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Pink-Rose-Sitia-Crete.jpg/330px-Pink-Rose-Sitia-Crete.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rose_(color)","wikidata":"Q533047"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Deco_21dec2006.jpg/330px-Deco_21dec2006.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Deco_21dec2006.jpg/330px-Deco_21dec2006.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Deco playing for Barcelona in the 2006–07 season","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADeco_21dec2006.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Deco_%28Chelsea%2C_2008%29.jpg/330px-Deco_%28Chelsea%2C_2008%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Deco_%28Chelsea%2C_2008%29.jpg/330px-Deco_%28Chelsea%2C_2008%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Deco taking a penalty kick for Chelsea in 2008","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADeco_(Chelsea%2C_2008).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Portugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jpg/500px-Portugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Portugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jpg/500px-Portugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jp